  "details": "So I was having an issue with console errors while in play mode trying to test Phys Bones and it seems to be related to the camera tags!\nCreating a camera marks it as Untagged by default which gives these errors in the console while clicking, changing the Tag on the camera to \"Main Camera\" fixes this issue and allows the user to test their bones as intended\nI'm mostly posting this to inform of the issue the only fix I could see is the console spitting out that there is no camera set to main camera in the scene, which seems like a duct tape fix",
